#
# PAM policy for ChatServer (jabberd2): pamauth(8) checks XMPP sign-ins
# against it, as Apple's ChatServer checked them against Open Directory.
#

# auth
auth		required	pam_unix.so		no_warn try_first_pass

# account
account		required	pam_nologin.so
account		required	pam_unix.so

# To let only the members of one group sign in, as Apple's chat service
# access list (SACL) did, uncomment this line and set the group:
#account	required	pam_group.so		luser group=chat
